               <bibl label="" xml:id="bibl_b189aea7">
                  <genre xml:id="genre_3fa30b46">book</genre>
                  <author xml:id="author_71c42747">Breitkopf</author>
                  <annot xml:id="annot_ce3c1606">
                     <p xml:id="idm87">
                        <lb xml:id="idm88"/>(Lot 678 (3)): '<rend xml:id="idm89" fontstyle="italic">Scheibe</rend>, 1 [Sinfonia] [Stimmen] 5 [Bog.]'; other composers in the same lot are Schaffarost, Schlick and Schlöger.</p>
